4,3443971,4030761,6466151,21203621,11181731,3881527,18820879,4806063,1622708,12443181,5864913,2528268,11089086,4559652,187001515,149687459,75836913,40330739,21162910,29675261,6913860,14879769,3676900,1365073,4507000,62528992,13080117,14555391,7826578,11266975,5658136,4348812,2547131,2512626,3648003,2696723,13046090,2810142,9218759,7871467,8906681,12089795,20120774,92751298,429562547,109537342,42577501,156530052,49865647,43175874,155777310,36545192,13348860,37694418,17493766,12017446,17615423,22139621,6469736,3004621,75984423,102410000,29818500,44250800,14525000,24628900,9356200,7962500,19875000,45700300,70947400,108136900,118741600,190775200,188211800,165311000,215677900,208511800,23000400,178570900,273190500,487465200,195680300,103777900,50125900,65468900,27271200,23115200,38498000,17281900,16463200,18838600,7661400,5783300,6646700,13851700,18748900,8078500,10925500,9803400,8744200,4839400,5601100,4984700,11048200,18780700,21649600,8385700,5194700,3039100,16443800,116026800,137228400,27533600,15590800,8694400,8560100,5156100,4592800]}},"profile":{"website":"https://www.mbgb.my","sector":"Consumer Cyclical","industry":"Lodging","employees":700,"city":"Kuala Lumpur","summary":"Meta Bright Group Berhad, an investment holding company, engages in property development and investment, and hotel operations businesses primarily in Malaysia and Australia. It operates through Investment Holding, Leasing and Financing, Hospitality, Investment Properties, Property Development, Energy Related, and Building Materials and Related Services divisions. The company offers electrical vehicles (EVs), and EV charging equipment and solutions; money lending services; and leasing services of machinery and equipment, such as short-term rental and its ancillary business services. It also engages in the investment advisory and leasing; supply of ready-mixed concrete, building materials, and cement; transportation activities; operation of generation facilities that produce electric energy, as well as charging stations; and renewable energy and energy efficiency related technology and businesses. The company was formerly known as EastLand Equity Bhd. and changed its name to Meta Bright Group Berhad in July 2022. Meta Bright Group Berhad was incorporated in 2000 is based in Kuala Lumpur, Malaysia.","zh":"Meta Bright Group Berhad 是一家投资控股公司，主要在马来西亚和澳大利亚从事房地产开发与投资以及酒店运营业务。公司前身为 EastLand Equity Bhd.，于2022年7月更名为现名，成立于2000年，总部位于马来西亚吉隆坡。","lines":["物业发展与投资：从事房地产开发和投资业务，客户为购房者及投资者。","酒店运营：经营酒店业务，客户为旅客。","租赁与融资：提供机械和设备租赁（如短期租赁及辅助服务）以及贷款服务，客户为企业。","投资控股与投资物业：进行投资控股、投资咨询和租赁，以及投资物业业务。","能源相关：提供电动汽车及充电设备和解决方案，运营发电设施和充电站，以及可再生能源和能效相关技术业务。","建筑材料：供应预拌混凝土、建筑材料和水泥，客户为建筑公司。"],"lines_en":["Property Development and Investment: Engages in property development and investment, serving homebuyers and investors.","Hotel Operations: Operates hotel businesses, serving travelers.","Leasing and Financing: Provides machinery and equipment leasing (including short-term rental and ancillary services) and money lending services to businesses.","Investment Holding and Investment Properties: Involves investment holding, investment advisory and leasing, and investment property businesses.","Energy Related: Offers electric vehicles and EV charging equipment and solutions, operates generation facilities and charging stations, and engages in renewable energy and energy efficiency related technology and businesses.","Building Materials: Supplies ready-mixed concrete, building materials, and cement to construction companies."]}}